    {
      "kind": "page",
      "number": 5,
      "title": "Why check condition in while loop?",
      "images": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Why check condition in while loop?",
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "para_break": true,
          "top": 0.123,
          "bottom": 0.214,
          "x0": 85.6,
          "cw": 18.59
        },
        {
          "text": "• In the example code, why do we check condition",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.24,
          "bottom": 0.301,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 9.45
        },
        {
          "text": "before calling wait?",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.292,
          "bottom": 0.348,
          "x0": 106.2,
          "cw": 10.64
        },
        {
          "text": "– In case the child has already run and done is true, then no",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.345,
          "bottom": 0.4,
          "x0": 115.2,
          "cw": 13.34
        },
        {
          "text": "need to wait",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.392,
          "bottom": 0.442,
          "x0": 137.8,
          "cw": 10.18
        },
        {
          "text": "• Why check condition with “while” loop and not “if”?",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.44,
          "bottom": 0.501,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 9.45
        },
        {
          "text": "– To avoid corner cases of thread being woken up even when",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.498,
          "bottom": 0.552,
          "x0": 115.2,
          "cw": 13.34
        },
        {
          "text": "condition not true (may be an issue with some",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.545,
          "bottom": 0.594,
          "x0": 137.8,
          "cw": 10.02
        },
        {
          "text": "implementations)",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.587,
          "bottom": 0.637,
          "x0": 137.8,
          "cw": 10.79
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "page",
      "number": 6,
      "title": "Why use lock when calling wait?",
      "images": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Why use lock when calling wait?",
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "para_break": true,
          "top": 0.123,
          "bottom": 0.214,
          "x0": 107.9,
          "cw": 18.56
        },
        {
          "text": "What if no lock is held when",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": true,
          "top": 0.299,
          "bottom": 0.361,
          "x0": 61.2,
          "cw": 12.26
        },
        {
          "text": "calling wait/signal?",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.357,
          "bottom": 0.42,
          "x0": 88.2,
          "cw": 11.54
        },
        {
          "text": "• Race condition: missed wakeup",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": true,
          "top": 0.5,
          "bottom": 0.561,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 9.45
        },
        {
          "text": "– Parent checks done to be 0, decides to sleep, interrupted",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.554,
          "bottom": 0.608,
          "x0": 115.2,
          "cw": 13.34
        },
        {
          "text": "– Child runs, sets done to 0, signals, but no one sleeping yet",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.601,
          "bottom": 0.655,
          "x0": 115.2,
          "cw": 13.34
        },
        {
          "text": "– Parent now resumes and goes to sleep forever",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.648,
          "bottom": 0.702,
          "x0": 115.2,
          "cw": 13.34
        },
        {
          "text": "• Lock must be held when calling wait and signal with CV",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.694,
          "bottom": 0.755,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 9.45
        },
        {
          "text": "• The wait function releases the lock before putting",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.747,
          "bottom": 0.808,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 9.45
        },
        {
          "text": "thread to sleep, so lock is available for signaling thread",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.794,
          "bottom": 0.85,
          "x0": 106.2,
          "cw": 10.28
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "page",
